00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:10.170
Just let it play out and to see where they
come to in this conflict.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:15.190
However, if the manager knows that the
conflict is personal or emotional or

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:17.820
it's about issues that are not so
important, such as about the process,

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:21.640
this is a conflict that you should cut off
and try to resolve offline.

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:24.550
Talk to the members individually, try to
get them on the same page again.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:28.815
So that would be the first step, is to
