00:03:28.815 --> 00:03:31.842
what their motivations are, and then to
deal with that.

00:03:31.842 --> 00:03:34.379
[MUSIC]

00:03:34.379 --> 00:03:37.890
So, task conflicts are, again, the most
productive form of conflict in teams.

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:40.880
And there's three other forms of conflict
that can occur in teams and

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:43.790
are generally likely to hurt team
performance.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:47.700
These three destructive types of conflict
in teams are process conflicts,

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:50.725
relationship conflicts, and status
conflicts.

00:03:50.725 --> 00:03:54.350
Process conflicts are conflicts about a
