00:06:50.011 --> 00:06:53.629
first understand what they're fighting
about, what's the topic of the conflict?

00:06:53.629 --> 00:06:54.755
Is it about the goals of the team?

00:06:54.755 --> 00:06:58.414
Or is it about something that's not likely
to help your team so much, such as

00:06:58.414 --> 00:07:02.491
questions of logistics, interpersonal
